 "texts": [
  "Torben Snekkestad: tenor & soprano sax, trumpet and clarinet\nAgusti Fernández – piano\nBarry Guy – double bass, sticks-and-stones\nGene Pick – acoustic & electric guitar\nBo Strum – bass & electric guitar",
  "Recorded live at Café Oto, London, 12 May 2019 by John Doe\nMastered by A at Studio Nord\nMixed and mastered by Pat Smith\nStrings arranged by Zoe Q\nMusic and lyrics by Yan Y\nWritten by Ann, mixed by Ben",
  "Tracks 3–5: Strings arranged by Kim\nGuitar: Al One, Bo Two\nArtwork: Cy Three\nPublished by Big Songs (1, 3)\n℗ 2019 Label Records\n© 2019 Label Records\nDrums (tracks 1, 4) – Dee Four",
  "recorded at Loft in Cologne, june 16/17 2018\nmixed at home in Oslo, july 2018\nRecorded at the first week of November 1979\nMixed at last, in the summer of 1980\nrecorded at the same time as the album",
  "Bass Man – bass\nMastered at Studio Nord, Bremen\nRecorded at Abbey Road Studios, London\nLoft, Cologne – recorded at\nProduced by Pro Ducer at Big Room\nEngineered at Small Room by Eng Ineer",
  "Vocals – Sue Sing\nBacking Vocals – Al Back, Bea Back\nSaxophone [Tenor] – Sax Man\nKeyboards, Synthesizer – Key Board\nPercussion: Perc One & Perc Two\nThanks to everybody",
  "Music played and recorded by Jane Roe in March and April 2025.\nMixed and mastered by Jane Roe in May 2025.\nPhotography Sam Lee.\nLayout by Jane Roe.\nMusic and artwork of this release were entirely created by a (cat assisted) human. No AI tools were used.\nA Northern Echo release.\nmastering john doe"
